I0826 10:05:51.234624   10876 conn_opt.go:53] jsonrpc2: --> notif: textDocument/didOpen: {"textDocument":{"uri":"file:///home/abijithasokan1992/CRAYONS_BRIDGE_ROADMAP.md","languageId":"markdown","version":1,"text":"# Crayons Bridge: Strategic Architecture \u0026 Roadmap\n\n## Vision\nCrayons Bridge is not just a MAM (Media Asset Management) system; it is the **Operational Layer** for the global Indian film supply chain. It orchestrates the lifecycle from production completion to global OTT/AI training distribution.\n\n## Core Architectural Pillars\n1. **Business Workflow over Storage:** Orchestrate relationships and rights, not just files.\n2. **Content Supply Chain:** Manage the acquisition, verification (QC), and delivery pipeline.\n3. **Regional Focus, Global Reach:** Specialized for Indic languages (Malayalam, Tamil, etc.) with Big Tech/OTT standards.\n\n## The Orchestration Stack (Implementation Priority)\n1. **Production ERP Integration:** Onboarding film projects and production metadata.\n2. **Title Registry \u0026 Metadata Manager:** Standardized schemas (EIDR/MEC) for regional assets.\n3. **Rights \u0026 Licensing Manager:** Tracking territorial, platform, and language-specific rights.\n4. **Partner \u0026 Buyer CRM:** Managing relationships with OTTs (JioStar, SonyLIV) and AI data buyers.\n5. **Delivery Manager:** Automated delivery workflows (DPP/EML specs).\n6. **Revenue \u0026 Contract Tracking:** Licensing marketplace and contract management.\n\n## Technical Roadmap\n### Phase 1: Foundation (Current)\n- [x] Oracle DB Schema (Projects, Inventory, Users)\n- [x] Gemini AI Integration (Content QC \u0026 Metadata Extraction)\n- [x] Basic Project Dashboard\n\n### Phase 2: Workflow Orchestration (Next)\n- [ ] Implement Rights Management Module\n- [ ] Create Buyer Pipeline \u0026 CRM Integration\n- [ ] Build Automated Delivery Workflow (Mock EML/DPP generation)\n- [ ] Integrate Contract Management \u0026 Revenue Tracking\n\n### Phase 3: Marketplace \u0026 Analytics\n- [ ] Licensing Marketplace UI\n- [ ] Global Distribution Analytics Dashboard\n- [ ] AI-driven Market Scout (Advanced Partner Matching)\n"}}
